-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §26 שעות גיל: age hours — an existing teacher
-- of 50 to 55 in a full position takes 2 frontal hours off, from 55 three
-- frontal hours and one individual hour; a new teacher of 50 or more takes
-- 2 frontal hours off and no more at 55. The age is the one on 31 December
-- of the school year, and the reduction runs from the year's start.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `26 שעות גיל`

DECLARE `age reduction` HAS
    `frontal hours off`    IS A NUMBER
    `individual hours off` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER, i IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `age reduction`
DECIDE `hours off` f i IS
    `age reduction` WITH
        `frontal hours off`    IS f
        `individual hours off` IS i

-- (ד): the age that counts is the age on 31 December of the school year
-- whose first half the year starts in; on the last day of a calendar year
-- everyone is that year less the year of birth.
@ref akn:art_26__para_d
GIVEN `year of birth` IS A NUMBER, `year the school year starts` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `age for the age hours` `year of birth` `year the school year starts` IS
    `year the school year starts` MINUS `year of birth`

-- (א)–(ב): an existing teacher in a full position; (ג): a new teacher. A
-- part-time teacher's age hours are §27(יא)'s.
@ref akn:art_26__para_a akn:art_26__para_b akn:art_26__para_c
GIVEN `an existing teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `in a full position` IS A BOOLEAN, age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `age reduction`
DECIDE `the age hours` `an existing teacher` `in a full position` age IS
    IF `an existing teacher`
    THEN BRANCH IF NOT `in a full position` THEN `hours off` 0 0
                IF age AT LEAST 55          THEN `hours off` 3 1
                IF age AT LEAST 50          THEN `hours off` 2 0
                OTHERWISE                        `hours off` 0 0
    ELSE IF age AT LEAST 50 THEN `hours off` 2 0 ELSE `hours off` 0 0

#ASSERT `the age hours` TRUE TRUE 54 EQUALS `hours off` 2 0
#ASSERT `the age hours` TRUE TRUE 55 EQUALS `hours off` 3 1
#ASSERT `the age hours` FALSE TRUE 60 EQUALS `hours off` 2 0
#ASSERT `the age hours` TRUE TRUE 49 EQUALS `hours off` 0 0
-- Born in 1958: 50 on 31.12.2008, so the reduction runs from 1.9.2008,
-- though the birthday may fall after the year has started.
#ASSERT `age for the age hours` 1958 2008 EQUALS 50

-- Over every age from 30 to 70: the reduction never shrinks with age, and
-- a new teacher's never passes an existing full-time teacher's.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD
                    (`the age hours` TRUE TRUE a)'s `frontal hours off` AT MOST (`the age hours` TRUE TRUE (a PLUS 1))'s `frontal hours off`
                AND (`the age hours` FALSE TRUE a)'s `frontal hours off` AT MOST (`the age hours` TRUE TRUE a)'s `frontal hours off`)
            (range 30 70)
